# Density on the tree, through the docked Graph tools panel: Gastner–Newman's
# evolving field, room following mass. Its signature is the rank of mass
# against area share and an even density, not energy (the flow writes
# positions). On the fixture the bar is qualitative (ruled 2026-10-03): from
# the boot start the rank rises above the start's and the density CV falls.
# Springs from the same start is the control (p4_tree_physics_density_control),
# and picking Density greys the overlays it refuses with the law's reason
# (it takes Hub room, Centre and Tide converted, F73 and F81).
assert snap ready == true
# The boot arrangement pauses the canvas, so the law is set and applied with
# nothing moving: its start is the boot layout, the control's too.
assert snap physics-paused == true
# An overlay ticked under Springs that Density refuses is greyed once
# Density is picked and leaves the choice, so Density applies alone.
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Springs
settle 1
click role:checkbox Grid
settle 1
assert snap panel-overlays == grid-snap
assert snap disabled-overlays == 0
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Density
settle 1
assert snap disabled-overlays == 5
assert text Density takes only Hub room, Centre and Tide
capture physics_density_refused
settle 2
click role:button Apply physics
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == density.gastner-newman
assert snap physics-profile == law.density
assert snap panel-profile == law.density
assert text Physics set to Density
assert snap physics-paused == true
log-layout density start
# No arrangement: the boot Spiral's anchor springs would pull under every
# law. Returning to none resumes the canvas.
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
assert snap physics-paused == false
capture physics_density_start
settle 2
# Until the flow stops (60 passes at least, then three calm ones, the
# 120-pass cap behind them): the law's own demand for ticks drops once its
# passes are done.
settle 7400
assert snap physics-continuous == false
capture physics_density_settled
# Framing (2026-10-04, "Density gets the check here"): every node's centre on
# the visible canvas at the frame this capture shows, after the settle.
assert snap layout-outside == 0
settle 2
log-layout density settled
assert snap layout-rank-rose == true
assert snap layout-cv-fell == true
assert snap layout-overlaps == 0
log physics density receipt complete
